{"ID":"20250828200427-ljck1t6","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250828200427-ljck1t6","title":"UPL2-6——Memory Profiler Package","type":"doc","updated":"20250829113736"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250828200427-lj1sld1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250828200427-lj1sld1","updated":"20250828201410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Memory Profiler Package"}]},{"ID":"20250828200655-s0ev3ex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828200655-s0ev3ex","updated":"20250828200721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Memory Profiler Package（内存分析器包），是 Unity 提供给我们的一个关于内存分析的独立工具\n它可以用于检查 Unity 应用程序以及 Unity 编辑器的内存使用情况\n我们可以使用它来捕获、检查、比较"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"内存快照"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！它获取的是当前时刻，全局的内存情况"}]},{"ID":"20250828200655-8wdz66k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828200655-8wdz66k","updated":"20250828200727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它和我们上节课学习的 Memory 模块都是用于分析内存的，但是他们的定位有所不同，功能深浅有所不同"}]},{"ID":"20250828200911-sf4y35m","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[1,1,1],"Properties":{"colgroup":"||","id":"20250828200911-sf4y35m","updated":"20250828200920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对比项"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Profiler - Memory 模块"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Memory Profiler（独立工具）"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实时监控"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"支持"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要用于快照分析"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用阶段"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开发中持续观察性能"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"排查具体内存泄漏 / 激增问题"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"查看细节"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粗略数据（贴图、网格、GC 内存等）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"精细到对象引用关系、类型大小、堆分布等"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是否支持快照对比"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不支持"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"支持多个快照对比"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是否能定位内存泄漏"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"部分可以推测"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"具备定位能力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是否支持深入引用链分析"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（即通过一层层追踪对象是如何被其他对象引用的）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不支持"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"支持"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性能开销"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"极小"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"略高（抓取快照时会卡顿）"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250828200957-1or27bx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828200957-1or27bx","updated":"20250828201004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从对比中可以看出 Memory Profiler Package 具备更细致的内存问题定位能力，可以帮助我们更加细致的排查问题"}]},{"ID":"20250828200957-20qy1p5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828200957-20qy1p5","updated":"20250828201015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总而言之：Memory Profiler Package 是一个比起 Profiler Memory 模块更加细致排查内存问题的模块"}]},{"ID":"20250828201039-qww1wzq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250828201039-qww1wzq","updated":"20250828201410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Memory Profiler Package 对于我们的意义"}]},{"ID":"20250828201048-v1ui748","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201048-v1ui748","updated":"20250828201158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它可以通过捕获不同时间点的内存快照并进行对比，来定位内存泄漏、资源未释放、异常增长等问题"}]},{"ID":"20250828201122-r7rlsb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201122-r7rlsb9","updated":"20250828201206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如当我们进行某些操作时，前后各生成两次快照，来分析内存问题："}]},{"ID":"20250828201115-4qcmwea","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250828201115-4qcmwea","updated":"20250828201131"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250828201115-is2rznk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250828201115-is2rznk","updated":"20250828201129"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250828201115-vzq1lr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201115-vzq1lr1","updated":"20250828201129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"打开一个 UI 面板前后"}]}]},{"ID":"20250828201115-jubhdss","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250828201115-jubhdss","updated":"20250828201131"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250828201115-i9xc8cp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201115-i9xc8cp","updated":"20250828201131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"运行 10 分钟前后"}]}]},{"ID":"20250828201115-zovapsm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250828201115-zovapsm","updated":"20250828201115"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250828201115-u192fi4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201115-u192fi4","updated":"20250828201116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"切换场景前后"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250828201117-82btft0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201117-82btft0","updated":"20250828201117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250828201057-j8p5hia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201057-j8p5hia","updated":"20250828201138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当我们想要："}]},{"ID":"20250828201138-xhh770t","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250828201138-xhh770t","updated":"20250828201138"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250828201138-jxxuas6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250828201138-jxxuas6","updated":"20250828201138"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250828201138-8e2awr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201138-8e2awr3","updated":"20250828201138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想要详细对比两次运行之间的内存差异"}]}]},{"ID":"20250828201138-dubg8ee","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250828201138-dubg8ee","updated":"20250828201138"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250828201138-3bu72kz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201138-3bu72kz","updated":"20250828201138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想要知道到底是什么对象一直不释放"}]}]},{"ID":"20250828201138-4t0qc0f","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250828201138-4t0qc0f","updated":"20250828201138"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250828201138-0ewpjx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201138-0ewpjx3","updated":"20250828201138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想要知道哪段代码导致了内存暴涨"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250828201136-k92fpkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201136-k92fpkc","updated":"20250828201145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等，就可以可以使用它"}]},{"ID":"20250828201213-10jr8h8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201213-10jr8h8","updated":"20250828201239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总而言之：\n想要更加深度的定位内存问题，我们可以使用它来进行排查，但是一般我们会配合上节课学习的 Memory 模块一起进行排查\n通过 Profiler 中的 Memory 大概定位问题，再通过 Memory Profiler 来进行详细排查，Profiler 是望远镜，Memory Profiler 是显微镜"}]},{"ID":"20250828201410-9nl81bw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250828201410-9nl81bw","updated":"20250828202742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"安装 Memory Profiler Package"}]},{"ID":"20250828201419-4jm4nma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201419-4jm4nma","updated":"20250828201457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 Package Manager 内即可安装，除此以外，还可以直接在 Profiler 内安装："}]},{"ID":"20250828201457-tlc7j9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201457-tlc7j9p","updated":"20250828201520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250828201520-x799pcq.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250828201705-szddvzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250828201705-szddvzc","updated":"20250828202742"},"Children":[{"Ty