Allocated Memory（已分配内存）"}]},{"ID":"20250829112311-ltpspqy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250829112311-ltpspqy","updated":"20250829112311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显示 Unity 已向操作系统申请的内存总量（可能在虚拟内存或被操作系统回收），一般比 驻留内存 大一些\n主要作用： 用来分析对象本身理论占用的内存量，可以快速判断大内存对象"}]}]},{"ID":"20250829112311-jfuibj5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250829112311-jfuibj5","updated":"20250829112311"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250829112311-tktps3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250829112311-tktps3t","updated":"20250829112311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Resident Memory on Device（驻留的内存）"}]},{"ID":"20250829112311-10uxnbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250829112311-10uxnbf","updated":"20250829112311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实际驻留在设备物理内存中的部分，表示当前确实占据了内存，排除了后台运行或系统清理后的内容，反应对象现在是否还在内存中\n主要作用： 在设备内存紧张时判断哪些对象仍常驻，可用于作为优化运行时内存压力的重要依据"}]}]},{"ID":"20250829112311-gx3oji5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250829112311-gx3oji5","updated":"20250829112311"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250829112311-0eahuar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250829112311-0eahuar","updated":"20250829112311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Allocated and Resident Memory on Device（分配和驻留的内存）"}]},{"ID":"20250829112311-m9tkpuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250829112311-m9tkpuj","updated":"20250829112311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"综合视图，显示对象分配的总内存以及在设备内存中的驻留情况，通常是最全面的视角。可以直观看出分类了多少，但真的再用的有多少\n主要作用： 找出大但驻留少的资源（说明是临时性的，加载后没用），找出分配不大但全部常驻的资源（说明常用）"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250829112214-xj3c0ps","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250829112214-xj3c0ps","updated":"20250829113521"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250829112214-qgtoj90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250829112214-qgtoj90","updated":"20250829112332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B：所选内容的详细信息"}]}